# Ad Placement Standards (Cursor)

Before changing tool-page ads:

1. Read `AGENTS.md`
2. Read `brain/AD_STANDARDS.md`

Rules:

- Use shared `AdSlot` + `lib/ads/placements.ts` only on `/tools/[slug]`.
- Never put ads on `/embed/[slug]` or inside calculator UI.
- Keep `ADS_DISPLAY_MODE` as `placeholder` until a real AdSense+consent task.
- Do not invent publisher/slot IDs or load third-party ad scripts.
